                  "id": "Q9C0I1"
                }
              ],
              "value": "Localizes to punctate vesicles when associated with MTM1 (By similarity). Localizes to triads, a structure formed by a T tubule and two sarcoplasmic reticulum terminal cisterna. In skeletal muscles, co-localizes with MTM1 in the sarcomere. Partially localizes to the sarcoplasmic reticulum in skeletal muscles (By similarity)"
            }
